('AP01','https://aiphotoprompt.io/prompts/transform-the-original-photo-into-a-playful-mixed-media-pop-art-portrait/','Photo plus flat illustrated interaction','Before/after shows a boy holding a cat; yellow ground, blue graphic wrap, oversized drawn glove and scattered motifs. Full prompt requests photographic people with flat mascot/doodles.','The physical/graphic contrast catches attention; wrapping a person is more than a colour filter.','Existing shoulder-motion avatar already occupies adjacent territory. Do not repeat graphic wraps or use the source child as an adult-fashion persona.','Keep an unmistakably photographic face; drawn limbs can look like extra anatomical limbs.'),
('AP02','https://aiphotoprompt.io/prompts/manual-1787386710681-9-qkq2a-gemini-generated-image-88j8hz88j8hz88j8/','Direct-flash candid with extreme foreground hand','Woman seated outside a restaurant, black lace outfit, glass, raised palm close to lens. Prompt specifies reference facial identity and early-2000s phone-flash imperfections.','Foreground hand gives immediacy, but restaurant styling alone is not a new transformation.','Retain intentional perspective as a mechanism; reject a flash-cafe duplicate.','Hand occlusion and beautification may reduce identity; prescribed makeup may override distinguishing features.'),
