('YM01','https://youmind.com/prompts/selective-object-material-editing-34191','Constrained object-only editing','Preview is a document screenshot, not a demonstrated chair-edit result. Full short prompt changes a white chair to wood while locking the surrounding scene.','Useful editing discipline rather than a youth-oriented image concept.','Separate the unchanged person/product from the changed set. No visual efficacy claim can be made from this document preview.','Material edits must not leak into skin, glasses or supplied product design.'),
('YM02','https://youmind.com/prompts/colossal-man-sitting-on-a-london-street-1792','Human/environment scale mismatch','Image shows a very large seated man among London buildings, buses and wet streets. Full prompt specifies reference face/body and an elevated wide view.','Everyday scale cues make the impossible legible immediately.','Use scale cues with an entirely different camera, action and spatial mechanism; do not make an Indian giant in another city.','A very wide shot can lose face detail; scale should be uniform rather than altered body proportions.'),
('YM03','https://youmind.com/prompts/amateur-snapshot-collage-prompt-34590','Intentional capture imperfections across a sequence','Visible grid places the same illustrated character in photographic surroundings with clipped framing, backlight and blur. Full prompt requests nine imperfect snapshots from an anime reference.','A supposed photo-dump suggests a shared life beyond one posed shot.','A single fictional memory can carry personality; avoid a nine-panel imitation and PicMagic’s existing multi-scene identity layout.','Repeated faces, intentional blur and cropped heads are unsuitable for small avatars; source illustration is not a real-person identity test.'),
